. This is file    boxplot.dp
.  Create a GIF file for a box plot
.
DEVICE 1 X11
.
TITLE Box Plot
TITLE SIZE 4
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
LABEL CASES ASIS
Y1LABEL Y
X1LABEL X
LABEL SIZE 4
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
.
CHARACTERS BOX PLOT
LINES BOX PLOT
PRE-ERASE OFF

. -----CASE 0--TYPICAL BOX PLOT
.
ERASE
. SET IPL1NA BOXPLOT0.PS
. SET IPL1NA boxplot0.ps
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
DELETE Y X
SKIP 25
READ SPLETT2.DAT Y X
X1LABEL Machine
Y1LABEL Energy
XLIMITS 1 4
MAJOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 4
MINOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 0
XTIC OFFSET 0.5 0.5
. X1TIC MARK LABEL FORMAT ALPHA
. X1TIC MARK LABEL CONTENT Tinius1 Tinius2 Satec Tokyo
X1TIC MARK LABEL CASE ASIS
CHARACTER BOX PLOT
LINE BOX PLOT
FENCES ON
.
BOX PLOT Y X
.
HEIGHT 4
MOVE 99 1
JUST RIGHT
TEXT SPLETT2.DAT
BOX 0 0 100 100
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
.
. -----DONE-----
.
SYSTEM mv dppl1f.dat boxplot0.ps
EXIT
